<title>CANADA: Wascana says still recommends CanOxy bid.</title>
<headline>Wascana says still recommends CanOxy bid.</headline>
<dateline>REGINA, Saskatchewan 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wascana Energy Inc said on Monday its board of directors continued to recommend shareholders tender to a C$2.0 billion offer from Canadian Occidental Petroleum Ltd, which expires at midnight Pacific time (0300 EDT/0700 GMT Tuesday).</p>
<p>The C$20.50 cash per share friendly offer for Wascana eclipsed a cash and stock bid from Talisman Energy Inc . Talisman dropped out of the race last week when it said it would not up its bid.</p>
